{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FLIP WAVE is an ultra-minimalist tactical simulation game!</strong><br>Amid endless sieges, manage firepower and aggro, take down more enemies, survive longer, and aim for a high score!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only 2 Player Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/melee_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" /><strong>Melee Unit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick to recover and draws enemy attention when charging into them.<br>Rush in as a group and crush your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/ranged_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" /><strong>Ranged Unit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fires explosive rounds to chip away at enemy groups' endurance.<br>But they\u2019re fragile\u2014stay on the move, work together, and neutralize enemy squads!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/core_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" />Clear the Battlefield with Bombs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your power meter fills up, you can unleash a bomb to wipe out enemies.<br>Will you save it for the perfect moment, or use it before things get risky?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/enemy1_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" />Enemies Don\u2019t Heal, But...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep one unit alive long enough to charge your bomb power?<br>Sometimes enemies will stop and switch to long-range mode. If you don\u2019t take them out, the battlefield becomes a bullet hell\u2014and you're on the ropes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/slow_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" />It's Intense!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s a limited-time slow-motion ability to help manage the chaos.<br>With clever use of shortcuts and filters, you might issue faster, sharper commands!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699520?t=1745834006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/4f7dc5b460349d2660b57ff73b8451d06e745380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745834006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/fa3727dc8d1f783b639c2f1884cca5c1ac142896/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745834006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/fa3727dc8d1f783b639c2f1884cca5c1ac142896/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745834006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FLIP WAVE is an ultra-minimalist tactical simulation game!</strong><br>Amid endless sieges, manage firepower and aggro, take down more enemies, survive longer, and aim for a high score!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only 2 Player Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/melee_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" /><strong>Melee Unit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick to recover and draws enemy attention when charging into them.<br>Rush in as a group and crush your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/ranged_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" /><strong>Ranged Unit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fires explosive rounds to chip away at enemy groups' endurance.<br>But they\u2019re fragile\u2014stay on the move, work together, and neutralize enemy squads!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/core_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" />Clear the Battlefield with Bombs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your power meter fills up, you can unleash a bomb to wipe out enemies.<br>Will you save it for the perfect moment, or use it before things get risky?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/enemy1_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" />Enemies Don\u2019t Heal, But...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep one unit alive long enough to charge your bomb power?<br>Sometimes enemies will stop and switch to long-range mode. If you don\u2019t take them out, the battlefield becomes a bullet hell\u2014and you're on the ropes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/slow_set_small.png?t=1745834006\" />It's Intense!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s a limited-time slow-motion ability to help manage the chaos.<br>With clever use of shortcuts and filters, you might issue faster, sharper commands!</p>","developers":["Uranus-net.com"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/88de5be4a564f4f820357d4c3ff39c5e27f76ef8/header.jpg?t=1745834006","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130509,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130509/movie480.mp4?t=1745834004","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130509/movie_max.mp4?t=1745834004"},"name":"Main Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset